# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Firmware — PlatformIO
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output and downloaded library sources. Regenerated by `pio run`.
firmware/.pio/
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.piolibdeps/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Controller — web app
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docs — website build output (tool TBD)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/node_modules/
docs/.cache/
docs/dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Electronics — KiCad transient files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep the .kicad_sch / .kicad_pcb / .kicad_pro sources; drop everything the
# tool regenerates.
*-backups/
*.kicad_prl
*.kicad_sch-bak
*.kicad_pcb-bak
fp-info-cache
~*.*
electronics/**/gerbers/
electronics/**/production/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mechanical — oversized binaries that GitHub cannot accept
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB, and Git LFS on the free tier
# caps individual files at 2 GB. The Rhino master model exceeds both limits and
# is distributed out-of-band instead — see mechanical/README.md.
#
#   mechanical/src/marvin_design.3dm   2.7 GB  (Rhino master model)
#
# Every STL is now tracked through Git LFS (see .gitattributes), 01_body.stl
# included — re-exporting it at a coarser mesh tolerance brought it to 12 MB.
mechanical/src/*.3dm

# Slicer output — never commit machine-specific G-code
*.gcode
*.3mf.bak
